    "kind": "function",
    "signature": "fn ident(name: impl Into<String>) -> Expr",
    "docs": "Create an unqualified column expression from the provided name, without normalizing\nthe column.\n\nFor example:\n\n```rust\n# use datafusion_expr::{col, ident};\nlet c1 = ident(\"A\"); // not normalized staying as column 'A'\nlet c2 = col(\"A\"); // normalized via SQL rules becoming column 'a'\nassert_ne!(c1, c2);\n\nlet c3 = col(r#\"\"A\"\"#);\nassert_eq!(c1, c3);\n\nlet c4 = col(\"t1.a\"); // parses as relation 't1' column 'a'\nlet c5 = ident(\"t1.a\"); // parses as column 't1.a'\nassert_ne!(c4, c5);\n```",
